        <headline>Storm Warning issued September 26 at 4:30AM EDT until September 27 at 6:00AM EDT by NWS Upton NY</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...North winds 30 to 40 kt with gusts up to 50 kt and seas
11 to 16 ft.

* WHERE...Sandy Hook NJ to Fire Island Inlet NY out 20 nm.

* WHEN...Until 6 AM EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Storm force winds and hazardous seas will capsize or
damage vessels and reduce visibility.
</description>
        <instruction>Mariners should remain in port, alter course, and/or secure the
vessel for severe conditions.</instruction>
